The native archive only needs the MMC client and protocol targets. Drop the
standalone codec daemon from the default target group so the native derivation
does not pull in the codec server; the separate floss-codec derivation applies
the codec-service patch and builds the daemon explicitly.

--- a/system/stack/mmc/BUILD.gn
+++ b/system/stack/mmc/BUILD.gn
@@ -23,7 +23,6 @@ group("mmc") {
     ":install_minijail_config",
     ":install_system_service",
     ":install_tmpfiles_config",
-    ":mmc_service",
     "//bt/system/stack/mmc/codec_client:libcodec_client",
     "//bt/system/stack/mmc/proto:mmc_config_proto",
   ]
